Class SessionSummarySchema:
- compact session row for history pages

Class SessionCreateRequest:
- create a persistent session from client_session_id and initial MatchContext

Class SessionCreatePayload:
- wrap the created SessionSummarySchema

Class SessionDetailPayload:
- return summary plus transcript object payload

Class SessionClaimRequest:
- submit local buffered SessionEvent records for claim

Class SessionClaimPayload:
- return claimed_event_count after save/claim
